<title>MALAYSIA: Malayawata Steel year net up 52 percent.</title>
<headline>Malayawata Steel year net up 52 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		43.38	   vs	   28.55</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)  32.28	   vs	   26.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		 514.34	   vs	  460.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  43.48	   vs	   35.17</p>
<p>    Minorities    less     0.15	   vs   less   0.14</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  nil	    vs   less   6.82</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)  15.0	    vs	   12.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malayawata Steel Bhd runs an integrated steel mill and is in the plantations business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
